      "action": "send_email(body=\"Dear NovaStar Industries Finance Department,\n\nThank you for contacting us regarding invoice INV-2024-1847.\n\nWe have completed both actions as requested:\n\n1. The disputed invoice INV-2024-1847 for $12,400 has been voided as it was confirmed to be a duplicate charge.\n\n2. Your account with our company has been closed effective immediately.\n\nYour account has been closed and the disputed charges have been voided. All related records and support cases have been updated accordingly.\n\nIf you have any further questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n\nSincerely,\nBilling Department\", subject=\"Confirmation: Invoice Voided and Account Closed - INV-2024-1847\", to=\"finance@novastarindustries.com\")",
